{#
  The invoice's other half: the coordinates it is made out to (#708,
  IT-18, moved as it was from « Documents »). On « Facture », beside the
  invoice they go on — nothing is paid from here, and the page a manager
  opens to make an invoice is the one that should hold what it says.

  **Folded once the name and the address are known** (chantier #927,
  §2.4), with both as its summary: an open form over data somebody
  already gave reads as data that was not saved. The VAT and enterprise
  numbers are optional and keep nothing open. While either is missing the
  box arrives open, as the task it is. collapse-label.js swaps « Modifier »
  and « Replier » with the fold, from the two attributes on the trigger.

  **The contract needs the name and the address** (issue #977, annex 8.1
  of the Walloon tourism code): no contract is generated without them, so
  the paragraph under the title says so. The same form names the group's
  responsible person on site, whom the contract names beside the renter.

  Requires `asset`, `booking`, `booking_page` and `billing`;
  `on_site_contact` is optional.
#}
{% set billing_known = billing.name and billing.address %}
<div class="card mb-3" id="coordonnees-facturation">
    <h2 class="mb-0">
        <button type="button"
                class="btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 p-3 text-start{{ billing_known ? ' collapsed' }}"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#coordonnees-facturation-body"
                aria-expanded="{{ billing_known ? 'false' : 'true' }}" aria-controls="coordonnees-facturation-body"
                data-collapse-label-collapsed="Modifier" data-collapse-label-expanded="Replier">
            <span class="flex-grow-1 min-w-0">
                <span class="h5 d-block mb-0">Coordonnées de facturation</span>
                {% if billing_known %}
                    <span class="small text-body-secondary d-block text-truncate" data-billing-summary>
                        {{ billing.name }} · {{ billing.address }}
                    </span>
                {% endif %}
            </span>
            <span class="small text-body-secondary" data-collapse-label>
                {{- billing_known ? 'Modifier' : 'Replier' -}}
            </span>
            <i class="bi bi-chevron-down text-body-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
    </h2>
    <div class="collapse{{ billing_known ? '' : ' show' }}" id="coordonnees-facturation-body">
        <div class="card-body pt-0">
            <p class="text-body-secondary small">
                Demandées au moment utile, pas au formulaire public : un visiteur qui se renseigne sur un
                week-end n'a aucune raison de taper un numéro de TVA. Tout est chiffré au repos.
                L'adresse est indispensable au contrat de location : sans elle, il ne se génère pas.
            </p>
            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/facturation" class="row g-2">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="{{ booking_page.value }}">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-name">Raison sociale</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-name" name="billing_name"
                           value="{{ billing.name }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-email">Email de facturation</label>
                    <input type="email" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-email" name="billing_email"
                           value="{{ billing.email }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-address">Adresse</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-address" name="billing_address"
                           value="{{ billing.address }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-4 col-md-2">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-country">Pays</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-country" name="billing_country"
                           maxlength="2" placeholder="BE" value="{{ billing.country }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-8 col-md-3">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-vat">N° de TVA</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-vat" name="billing_vat_number"
                           value="{{ billing.vat_number }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-enterprise">N° BCE</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-enterprise"
                           name="billing_enterprise_number" value="{{ billing.enterprise_number }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-6 col-md-4">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-reference">Référence / bon de commande</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="billing-reference"
                           name="billing_reference" value="{{ billing.reference }}">
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="on-site-contact-name">Responsable du groupe sur place</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="on-site-contact-name"
                           name="on_site_contact_name" maxlength="200"
                           value="{{ on_site_contact.name ?? '' }}" aria-describedby="on-site-contact-help">
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="on-site-contact-phone">Téléphone du responsable</label>
                    <input type="tel" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="on-site-contact-phone"
                           name="on_site_contact_phone" maxlength="40"
                           value="{{ on_site_contact.phone ?? '' }}" aria-describedby="on-site-contact-help">
                </div>
                <p class="col-12 form-text mt-0" id="on-site-contact-help">
                    Une personne majeure présente pendant tout le séjour, que le contrat nomme.
                </p>
                <div class="col-12">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Enregistrer</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
